# MASTER BUILD PROMPT: JEY LEARNING HUB — COMPLETE FUNCTIONAL ONLINE TUTORING PLATFORM

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, software architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer and QA engineer.

Your task is to **design and build a complete, production-oriented online tutoring platform called Jey Learning Hub**.

This is not a request for a static website, landing-page template, visual prototype or dashboard mockup. I want a real, working web application with a public website, authentication, database, teacher/admin dashboard, parent portal, student dashboard, class scheduling, video conferencing, lesson recordings, AI-generated lesson summaries, assignments, payments, notifications and reporting.

**FUNCTIONALITY IS THE HIGHEST PRIORITY.**

A beautiful interface with non-functional buttons, fake information, sample dashboards or simulated integrations is not acceptable. Every feature must either work or clearly indicate that it requires configuration. Never pretend an integration is connected when it is not.

